Approach: Sorting + Two Pointer

This is an extension of 3Sum.

Sort the array.
Fix first element i.
Fix second element j.
Use two pointers:
k = j + 1
l = n - 1
Calculate sum:
If sum == target → store quadruplet, move both pointers
If sum > target → l--
If sum < target → k++

Time Complexity: O(n^3)
Space Complexity: O(1) (excluding output)
